    "description": "Set of six antique British sterling silver spoons featuring matching engraved heraldic crests at the handle terminals. Each crest includes a hand/arm motif beneath crosses with the motto “VICTORIOUS.”\n\nThe stems bear multiple traditional British-style hallmarks. The visible lion passant is the English sterling standard mark, indicating .925 sterling silver. [oai_citation:0Antique Silver Spoons](https://antiquesilverspoons.co.uk/knowledge-center/hallmarks/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\nThe additional struck marks are visibly worn and have not been conclusively attributed to a specific maker, assay office, or exact year; please review the close-up hallmark photos.\n\nIncludes:\n6 matching sterling silver spoons\n\nApprox. dimensions:\nEach spoon approximately 9\" L\nPlease see measurement photos for additional details.\n\nTotal weight:\nApproximately 434 grams for all 6 spoons combined.\n\nCondition:\nAntique pre-owned condition with surface scratches, tarnish, patina, discoloration, rubbing, and age-related wear. Hallmarks show varying degrees of wear. Engraved crests remain visible.\n\nPlease review all photos for hallmark details, measurements, weight, engraving, and condition.\nNote: The blue Galt & Bro. storage roll shown in some photos is not original to the spoons and is not included.",
